  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "policy",
      "title": "Bootstrap and normal authorization",
      "items": [
        "DM_BOOTSTRAP_TOKEN is accepted only by POST /admin/v1/auth/bootstrap to create the first stored root credential. Normal routes authenticate stored principal tokens.",
        "Roles, granular actions, canonical resources and request context govern operational access. Root-only authority management is checked separately; data-plane requests use policy evaluation."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "transport",
      "title": "Current route coverage",
      "items": [
        "The unified admin API manages commands, declarative state, Blueprints, application identity discovery, profiles, Apple service clients, certificates, audit and native webhooks.",
        "Route metadata resolves enrollment scope and command-specific actions. Sensitive webhook representations require separate sensitive-management or sensitive-replay grants."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "policy",
      "title": "Authorization results",
      "items": [
        "Invalid credentials return 401; denied permissions return 403. Policy documents are validated against the registered schema and actions before activation.",
        "Root authority administration protects the credential and policy recovery path. Allowed mutations and sensitive reads participate in audit capture."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "authentication",
      "title": "CLI credentials",
      "items": [
        "Reference tokens through a protected file or environment variable. Unix checks reject group/other access. Windows uses explicit ACL protection for the current user, LocalSystem and administrators.",
        "Remote setup and event commands use route authorization. Local setup requires the setup file and its secret references; offline explanation, local setup and bench supervision do not use this HTTP request path."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "transport",
      "title": "Public documentation",
      "items": [
        "Cedar authorization overview — https://docs.cedarpolicy.com/",
        "Sending MDM commands to a device — https://developer.apple.com/documentation/devicemanagement/sending-mdm-commands-to-a-device",
        "Deploying device management enrollment profiles — https://developer.apple.com/documentation/devicemanagement/deploying-device-management-enrollment-profiles",
        "Setup authorization — https://github.com/deploymenttheory/go-apple-dm/blob/2b8157efa2c6cbfff459bc44f66736a5d2e7c753/server/internal/app/adminsetup.go",
        "Event administration — https://github.com/deploymenttheory/go-apple-dm/blob/2b8157efa2c6cbfff459bc44f66736a5d2e7c753/server/internal/app/adminevents.go",
        "Cross-platform credential files — https://github.com/deploymenttheory/go-apple-dm/blob/2b8157efa2c6cbfff459bc44f66736a5d2e7c753/server/internal/privatefile/doc.go"
